  "summary": "C6 reads the /tmp/sub.nc subset written in C4 (full daily coverage 1991-12-27 to 2003-08-31, the 60x60 region). It computes per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day baseline windows and smooths them over 31 days. Target days June 1 to Aug 31 use smoothed day-of-year 153-244, so they draw on raw thresholds for days 138-259 and thus on baseline values from May 12 to Sep 20 of each year 1992-2002. The 2003 summer SSTs are compared against these thresholds, then hot-run detection and gap joining run per sea cell before the mask is saved."
